# Mechanic: A continuous keyword grant projects its identity and reminder text.
# Forcing: Metallic Sliver attacks into Those Who Serve at one life.
# AI behavior: The defender must block to survive the attack.
# Failure modes: Missing grant or unchanged blocker stats identify the failed seam.
# Card roles: Sidewinder grants flanking; Metallic attacks; Those Who Serve blocks.
# Protocol path: AddAbility, DeclareAttackersReq, trigger resolution, stat updates.
